 09","Kode 9","コード9"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/214748-Kode9","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.kode9.com/","https://www.facebook.com/djkode9","https://twitter.com/kodenine","https://instagram.com/kode9","https://myspace.com/kode9","https://kode9.blogspot.com/","https://www.surefireagency.com/index.php/artist/kode9/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kode9","https://www.whosampled.com/Kode9/","https://soundcloud.com/kodenine","https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL333NRV9w0mW14sJD45qRJPw0b4MqMROb"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/215582/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"215582","image":"https://i.discogs.com/RrEkouD5-fGcs-W7b6OxLz4vZIwp6ah97qwKKW0FRi4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:433/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTIxNTU4/Mi0xNzU2Nzk1NzMw/LTQ2NDQuanBlZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/gyb9h66BpbPoTnhpcRFgkSdrsm2TD8W5tYrJ1AUA_iM/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTIxNTU4/Mi0xNzU2Nzk1NzMw/LTQ2NDQuanBlZw.jpeg","profile":"Disco - funk band, formed in the late 1960's, New York City, NY, USA.\r\nActive in the 1970s and '80s, they released an impressive 22 albums in two decades, at labels as [l=Perception Records (5)], [l=Event Records Inc.], [l=Spring Records], and [l=Cotillion] respectively.\r\nThey were the band concept of innovative drummer [a=Bill Curtis], aiming to merge the \"fatback\" jazz beat of New Orleans into a funk band.\r\nThey had seminal hits like \"(Do The) Spanish Hustle\", \"I Like Girls\", \"Gotta Get My Hands on Some (Money)\", and \"Backstrokin'\". Their 1979 single \"King Tim III (Personality Jock)\" is sometimes considered the first hip hop single.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:215582","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":1222148,"name":"Macho (6)"}],"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":29967,"name":"Reuben Wilson"},{"active":true,"id":83241,"name":"Donna McGhee"},{"active":false,"id":108809,"name":"Janice Christie"},{"active":true,"id":116038,